# Fang-Druid Summoner: Bot1 wheels Grizzly Bears, Llanowar Elves and Ornithopter into its graveyard on turn 1, then casts the Summoner on
# turn 3 and Accepts both the "may" and the library: the graveyard and the library are searched together. The Hill Giant in the library and
# the Grizzly Bears in the graveyard both qualify (no abilities); Llanowar Elves and Ornithopter do not. Bot1 takes the Grizzly Bears from
# the graveyard. The library was searched (even though the card came from the graveyard), so it is shuffled (CR 701.24a), and the Hill
# Giant stays in it.

